<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40932" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισπέρχ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>urge on</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.451
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππους] κέντρῳ ἐπισπέρχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.430
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆα] ἐρετμοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.346
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πρᾶγμα κάρτ᾽ ἐπισπέρχει θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					689
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἄλλους τοιαῦτα ἐπέσπερχε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.12
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i>urge</i> one to do, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.525
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.347b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἴχνος</span>
			<i>follow close upon</i> the track, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				4.96
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				144
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. intr.,
				<i>rage furiously</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισπέρχουσιν ἄελλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.304
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Parth.</u>
				2.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τι ἡ πνὶξ ἐπισπέρχοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					1.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			<i>hasten</i> in flight, <i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				98
			</span></i>.</div>
